---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Engagement Models | Prodory" description="Diagnostic, fixed-scope delivery and co-engineering pods. Choose the model that fits your team and your timeline." path="/engagement-models/">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Engagement models</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-[#4B5563]">Three ways to work together. Pricing for each is set in a written estimate after discovery; this page does not publish rates.</p>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded border border-[#E5E7EB] p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Diagnostic</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#4B5563]">A fixed-scope review of one platform area, with a written decision and a ranked list of changes. Typically two to three weeks.</p></div>
      <div class="rounded border border-[#E5E7EB] p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Fixed-scope delivery</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#4B5563]">A defined set of deliverables, such as a cluster build, a migration wave or an automation estate, with an agreed acceptance checklist.</p></div>
      <div class="rounded border border-[#E5E7EB] p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Co-engineering pod</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#4B5563]">Platform engineers who work inside your team, under your repositories and your security rules, with a handover plan.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
